+| --- | --- |
+| [`ALIASES`](../../history/1.7.0/engine.py#L43) | `정의=dict(jpeg="jpg", jpe="jpg", tif="tiff", heif="heic", htm="html", markdown="md", aif="aiff", tgz="tar.gz")` |
+| [`TOOLS`](../../history/1.7.0/engine.py#L44) | `정의={     "ffmpeg": ("FFmpeg", "Gyan.FFmpeg", "오디오 · 비디오"),     "pandoc": ("Pandoc", "JohnMacFarlane.Pandoc", "전자책 · 문서"),     "soffice": ("LibreOffice", "TheDocumentFoundation.LibreOffice", "Office 문서 · 발표 · 표"), }` |
