+| [`OLE32`](../../history/%ED%83%AD%EC%9E%94%EC%83%81-%EC%9E%91%EC%97%85%EC%A0%84/app.py#L48) | `정의=ctypes.WinDLL("ole32", use_last_error=True)` |
+| [`SHELL32`](../../history/%ED%83%AD%EC%9E%94%EC%83%81-%EC%9E%91%EC%97%85%EC%A0%84/app.py#L55) | `정의=ctypes.WinDLL("shell32", use_last_error=True)` |
+| [`EXPLORER_CLASSES`](../../history/%ED%83%AD%EC%9E%94%EC%83%81-%EC%9E%91%EC%97%85%EC%A0%84/app.py#L65) | `정의={"CabinetWClass", "ExploreWClass", "Progman", "WorkerW"}` |
