+| [`OLE32`](../../history/%ED%98%B8%EB%B2%84%EB%8C%80%EB%B9%84-%EC%9E%91%EC%97%85%EC%A0%84/app.py#L48) | `정의=ctypes.WinDLL("ole32", use_last_error=True)` |
