+Name: xlsxwriter
+Version: 3.2.9
+Summary: A Python module for creating Excel XLSX files.
+Home-page: https://github.com/jmcnamara/XlsxWriter
+Author: John McNamara
+Author-email: jmcnamara@cpan.org
